Package: com.phoni.phonilink
Name: PhoniLink
Version: 0.1.0~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Call another phone nearby with PhoniLink.
 Open PhoniLink on both phones, enable nearby calling, then tap a phone to call.
 Includes two-way audio, incoming-call controls, mute, and speakerphone.
 Both apps must stay open in this first beta. No cellular call rerouting.
 Use the same Wi-Fi network. Apple's nearby transport may also use peer-to-peer Wi-Fi.
 The other phone can use the companion IPA without a jailbreak:
 https://realphoni.github.io/phoni-repo/phonilink.html
 Compiled for iOS 12 and later; physical-device and modern-iOS testing still needed.
Maintainer: Phoni
Author: Phoni
Section: Multimedia
Tag: role::enduser
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
